message: >-
  If this software or its experimental protocols support your work, please cite
  the repository and the exact release used.
title: Foundation Model Lab
type: software
authors:
  - name: Foundation Model Lab contributors
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-04
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A resource-aware, reproducible laboratory for foundation-model adaptation,
  multimodal LoRA and response distillation, visual reward design, reliable
  agent evaluation, controlled inference-systems studies, actual two-rank CPU
  distributed-training correctness, compact transformers, and executable code
  agents.
